== Colors ==
You can refer to [[Unidentified Dye/Unlocks]] to track the unlock progress.

There are 382 possible [[Dye#Colors|dye colors]] that can drop from an Unidentified Dye including 181 {{rarity|fine|Common}}, 119 {{rarity|Masterwork|Uncommon}}, and 82 {{rarity|rare|Rare}}.

